@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
state "原件待确认" as Pending
state "原件已确认" as Valid
state "退回核对" as Returned
state "缺失或不可读" as Missing
[*] --> Pending : 核对原件完整性\n[文件实际保存且校验通过]\n/ 保留来源和归属
Pending --> Valid : 保留确认原件\n[牙医核对内容及归属]\n/ 保留确认人和时间
Pending --> Returned : 退回原件核对\n[关联或内容不符]\n/ 保留原件与原因
Valid --> Missing : 报告读取异常\n[文件缺失或校验不符]\n/ 保留原业务关联
Missing --> Valid : 核实恢复原件\n[恢复文件与原校验一致]\n/ 保留恢复依据

@enduml
